# secrets and PII - never commit these.
#
# Rosters do not arrive named roster.csv. They arrive named whatever the SIS or
# Google Forms called them -- "CS 378 Groups - Form Responses 1.csv" -- and that
# one carries student names and EIDs, so matching two exact filenames is one
# `git add -A` away from pushing a class list to a public remote. Ignore every
# CSV instead and allow back the one fixture the manual checklist needs.
tokens.csv
roster.csv
*.csv
!test-roster.csv

